{"fondo": "est:liso:#efebdf:#d9e3f2", "fuente": "", "tam": 0, "forma": "", "html": "<div style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(59, 111, 224);\"><span style=\"font-size: 17px; font-family: &quot;Gloria Hallelujah&quot;;\">Wednesday, 11 November 2026</span><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Ribeye Marrow&quot;; font-size: 32px;\">&nbsp;</span></span></div><div style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(59, 111, 224);\"><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Ribeye Marrow&quot;; font-size: 32px;\"><br></span></span></div><div style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(59, 111, 224);\"><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Ribeye Marrow&quot;; font-size: 32px;\">Dear</span>&nbsp;</span></div><div style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Great Vibes&quot;; font-size: 26px; color: rgb(59, 111, 224);\">Diary</span></div><div style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(59, 111, 224);\"><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Great Vibes&quot;; font-size: 26px;\"><br></span></span></div><div style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Gloria Hallelujah&quot;; font-size: 18px; color: rgb(59, 111, 224);\">Today I had breakfast with Marta at the café on the corner, the one with the mismatched cups. We ordered toast with tomato and talked for so long that our coffee went cold.</span></div><div style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Gloria Hallelujah&quot;; font-size: 18px; color: rgb(59, 111, 224);\"><br></span></div><div style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Gloria Hallelujah&quot;; font-size: 18px; color: rgb(59, 111, 224);\">In the afternoon I went for a walk with no plan. The light was beautiful, the kind that turns everything golden, and I stopped to take photos of the trees in the park, which are starting to change colour.</span></div><div style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Gloria Hallelujah&quot;; font-size: 18px; color: rgb(59, 111, 224);\"><br></span></div><div style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Gloria Hallelujah&quot;; font-size: 18px; color: rgb(59, 111, 224);\">Lately I feel calmer. I think it’s because I’ve stopped rushing around and I’m giving myself permission not to do everything perfectly.</span></div><div style=\"text-align: left;\"><br></div><div style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Gloria Hallelujah&quot;; font-size: 18px; color: rgb(59, 111, 224);\">Tomorrow I want to go to bed early, read for a while and start the day slowly.</span></div><div style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Gloria Hallelujah&quot;; font-size: 18px; color: rgb(59, 111, 224);\"><br></span></div><div style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Gloria Hallelujah&quot;; font-size: 18px; color: rgb(59, 111, 224);\">Good night, diary ♡</span></div><div style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Gloria Hallelujah&quot;; font-size: 18px; color: rgb(59, 111, 224);\"><br></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Gloria Hallelujah&quot;; font-size: 18px; color: rgb(59, 111, 224);\"><br></span></div><div><br></div>", "capa": "<div class=\"libre pegatina\" data-tipo=\"pegatina\" data-x=\"0.1456\" data-y=\"0.2472\" data-w=\"0.1287\" data-r=\"7.7\" data-z=\"2\" style=\"left: 55.9104px; top: 94.9248px; width: 49.4208px; transform: rotate(7.7deg); z-index: 2; --asa: 19px;\"><img src=\"pegatinas/p/fiestas/collage/06.webp\" alt=\"\" draggable=\"false\"></div><div class=\"libre pegatina\" data-tipo=\"pegatina\" data-x=\"0.2145\" data-y=\"0.3525\" data-w=\"0.0886\" data-r=\"41.1\" data-z=\"3\" style=\"left: 82.368px; top: 135.36px; width: 34.0224px; transform: rotate(41.1deg); z-index: 3; --asa: 18px;\"><img src=\"pegatinas/p/fiestas/collage/06.webp\" alt=\"\" draggable=\"false\"></div>"}